  "details": "Allow the player to keymap their own controllers' buttons. Want to swap touching the touchpad to move the character and clicking to do emotes instead? You got it.\nWant to take off interaction on the left controller's trigger so you can express things with your left fist without sitting down? You got it.\nWant to have twice the amount of animations able to be programmed by separating each controller and rigging the left to activate a whole different selection than the right? You got it.",
